  "description": "Zumpo/Mobile tabs: a phone room shows one of board, players and chat at a time. Chat unread marks lines that arrived while another tab was open (Unread count, 9+ at most); opening Chat clears it. Board turn marks the Game tab \"Your turn\" (lime) while another tab is open and it is the viewer's go; opening Game clears it.",
